The '''bloodthirst'''{{Sic}} '''rockslug''' was an unused variant of the [[giant rockslug]], the [[superior]] variant of the [[rockslug]], that would have appeared after unlocking the [[Bloodthirsty]] [[Trailblazer Reloaded League/Relics|relic]] in [[Trailblazer Reloaded League]]. Because rockslugs could not be assigned as a Slayer task during the league, it was never possible to encounter a bloodthirst rockslug.

It would have had a 25% chance of spawning in place of a giant rockslug, which have a 4% chance of appearing after killing a rockslug.

==Drops==
Had the bloodthirst rockslug been possible to kill, it would have provided 9 rolls on the rockslug drop table and a roll on the bloodthirsty unique drop table.

